  {
    "http": 18,
    "window_ordinal": 17,
    "window_id": "704335e4-2504-59a4-80b7-00554ada8db3",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "text": "Settings\nThese are the settings used for configuring the feed exports:",
        "text_sha256": "04eb0b82c517001438a39f6b211e20ed6b6bb4be33f50ee6f7e0e3ab27c42b8c",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 14221,
            "end": 14292,
            "line_start": 361,
            "line_end": 363
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "- `FEEDS` (mandatory)\n- `FEED_EXPORT_ENCODING`\n- `FEED_STORE_EMPTY`\n- `FEED_EXPORT_FIELDS`\n- `FEED_EXPORT_INDENT`\n- `FEED_STORAGES`\n- `FEED_STORAGE_FTP_ACTIVE`\n- `FEED_STORAGE_S3_ACL`\n- `FEED_EXPORTERS`\n- `FEED_EXPORT_BATCH_ITEM_COUNT`",
        "text_sha256": "6b0679b6f3526258cb32abe25df5f2e5b7887547f52c8e3326511e668930eb2c",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 14294,
            "end": 14529,
            "line_start": 365,
            "line_end": 374
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "FEEDS\nDefault: `{}`",
        "text_sha256": "de8e2c535d773fef00bcc2fbd82c1b3ff848a8917223c14d07141752f4b3925e",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 14535,
            "end": 14555,
            "line_start": 376,
            "line_end": 378
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "http": 19,
    "window_ordinal": 18,
    "window_id": "a7b664a6-1df3-5873-aee8-bddbb8e523aa",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "text": "The following is a list of the accepted keys and the setting that is used\nas a fallback value if that key is not provided for a specific feed definition:",
        "text_sha256": "24df217b50be8addb84cd93158de3511280d7fabc52c0fe716e8149485e1487a",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 15729,
            "end": 15882,
            "line_start": 420,
            "line_end": 421
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "- `format`: the serialization format.",
        "text_sha256": "633b2c44ddb04eeae07436df887e3d9987cb1828ee31e087afa0293b178d2b6c",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 15884,
            "end": 15921,
            "line_start": 423,
            "line_end": 423
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "This setting is mandatory, there is no fallback value.\n- `batch_item_count`: falls back to\n`FEED_EXPORT_BATCH_ITEM_COUNT`.\n- `encoding`: falls back to `FEED_EXPORT_ENCODING`.\n- `fields`: falls back to `FEED_EXPORT_FIELDS`.\n- `item_classes`: list of [item classes](items.html#topics-items) to export.",
        "text_sha256": "63280be8bf1cb4daeb204592125a227f45459d6fe811974f434ace5b1c6b1445",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 15923,
            "end": 16222,
            "line_start": 425,
            "line_end": 430
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "If undefined or empty, all items are exported.\n- `item_filter`: a filter class to filter items to export.",
        "text_sha256": "2f448995c98e9e3ad453a638c9d26ea838f89388188f6ce093fbf83ea9da8cba",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 16224,
            "end": 16329,
            "line_start": 432,
            "line_end": 433
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "`ItemFilter` is used be default.\n- `indent`: falls back to `FEED_EXPORT_INDENT`.\n- `item_export_kwargs`: [`dict`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/stdtypes.html#dict) with keyword arguments for the corresponding [item exporter class](exporters.html#topics-exporters).\n- `overwrite`: whether to overwrite the file if it already exists\n(`True`) or append to its content (`False`).",
        "text_sha256": "2a3cb24d7305d4e3c6d1f32c432e37a6a6cb91a3cbbcd9b3d48e03a0c544b81c",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 16331,
            "end": 16710,
            "line_start": 435,
            "line_end": 439
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The default value depends on the storage backend:\n  - Local filesystem: `False`\n  - FTP: `True`",
        "text_sha256": "e1434d60c39d31fd4227923a998beadef34b79c3973c8e1cb587479321ba2dad",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 16712,
            "end": 16807,
            "line_start": 441,
            "line_end": 443
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Some FTP servers may not support appending to files (the\n`APPE` FTP command).\n  - S3: `True` (appending is not supported)\n  - Google Cloud Storage (GCS): `True` (appending is not supported)\n  - Standard output: `False` (overwriting is not supported)\n- `store_empty`: falls back to `FEED_STORE_EMPTY`.\n- `uri_params`: falls back to `FEED_URI_PARAMS`.\n- `postprocessing`: list of plugins to use for post-processing.",
        "text_sha256": "0ba0d92fe54645bca40a1568aaed5bc2c17068bfd8e3e2b669c2b6cd96521fa2",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 16809,
            "end": 17222,
            "line_start": 445,
            "line_end": 452
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The plugins will be used in the order of the list passed.",
        "text_sha256": "db985fe8518d792622dd58ba9fd7bdc62c9c0d14bddb0be83c07ce878d80020c",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 17224,
            "end": 17281,
            "line_start": 454,
            "line_end": 454
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "http": 20,
    "window_ordinal": 19,
    "window_id": "2fa7fe61-a81c-5937-a927-2815365d7ab8",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "text": "When generating multiple output files, you must use at least one of the following\nplaceholders in the feed URI to indicate how the different output file names are\ngenerated:",
        "text_sha256": "38363b9a1a3d0645163bb2acf0ba9d1629e69546f373222a01cf061a18193fb0",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 21623,
            "end": 21796,
            "line_start": 590,
            "line_end": 592
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "- `%(batch_time)s` - gets replaced by a timestamp when the feed is being created\n(e.g. `2020-03-28T14-45-08.237134`)\n- `%(batch_id)d` - gets replaced by the 1-based sequence number of the batch.",
        "text_sha256": "107722f8da921d765eab31765ef4efc69f3888c2deda1707ccb63553a44fe397",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 21798,
            "end": 21992,
            "line_start": 594,
            "line_end": 596
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Use [printf-style string formatting](https://docs.python.org/3/library/stdtypes.html#old-string-formatting) to\nalter the number format. For example, to make the batch ID a 5-digit\nnumber by introducing leading zeroes as needed, use `%(batch_id)05d`\n(e.g. `3` becomes `00003`, `123` becomes `00123`).",
        "text_sha256": "3d03f06b726e3a178f8499038bfd2813090841e67e2c7dd2d23423a7cc84145d",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 21994,
            "end": 22293,
            "line_start": 598,
            "line_end": 601
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "http": 21,
    "window_ordinal": 20,
    "window_id": "1bce9ce2-5bb3-5a1f-962a-90d5a1e8cd61",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "text": "**Parameters:**",
        "text_sha256": "4cffbfc0f3f64ea67829f54830a99f6c1f41f61e25dba76d3216babd93239d28",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 9759,
            "end": 9774,
            "line_start": 259,
            "line_end": 259
          },
          {
            "start": 10198,
            "end": 10213,
            "line_start": 267,
            "line_end": 267
          },
          {
            "start": 13354,
            "end": 13369,
            "line_start": 338,
            "line_end": 338
          },
          {
            "start": 23451,
            "end": 23466,
            "line_start": 643,
            "line_end": 643
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "- **params** ([*dict*](https://docs.python.org/3/library/stdtypes.html#dict)) –",
        "text_sha256": "e8b2b69a067e422c337d208954f2dbe4fbf965730b3e8f47e51f47a4c4c90de5",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 23468,
            "end": 23547,
            "line_start": 645,
            "line_end": 645
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "default key-value pairs",
        "text_sha256": "4fa60dae9e43e1406213fa69e4beda5afa238c668f1281ed857cc07725b59331",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 23549,
            "end": 23572,
            "line_start": 647,
            "line_end": 647
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Specifically:\n  - `batch_id`: ID of the file batch. See\n`FEED_EXPORT_BATCH_ITEM_COUNT`.",
        "text_sha256": "64e20b10f10750370b932a80949332a91aaec1b49668b79450041eb5aff1363c",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 23574,
            "end": 23661,
            "line_start": 649,
            "line_end": 651
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "If `FEED_EXPORT_BATCH_ITEM_COUNT` is `0`, `batch_id`\nis always `1`.\n  - `batch_time`: UTC date and time, in ISO format with `:`\nreplaced with `-`.",
        "text_sha256": "9a5071d3e2d91de513268e1398a5f40cd828225d3df4bc33be69004c06ccfd08",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 23663,
            "end": 23809,
            "line_start": 653,
            "line_end": 656
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "See `FEED_EXPORT_BATCH_ITEM_COUNT`.\n  - `time`: `batch_time`, with microseconds set to `0`.\n- **spider** ([*scrapy.Spider*](spiders.html#scrapy.Spider)) – source spider of the feed items",
        "text_sha256": "cf75b07c85563cd02534aa37ca0e3c4551e015685ce584e5aa7d5f52ec186569",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 23811,
            "end": 23997,
            "line_start": 658,
            "line_end": 660
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The function should return a new dictionary, modifying\nthe received `params` in-place is deprecated.",
        "text_sha256": "5ea63ff1601ba2c20c93617ebaea7de5b3a837ee3caab287ab3e45d8e50650a1",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 23999,
            "end": 24099,
            "line_start": 662,
            "line_end": 663
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "http": 22,
    "window_ordinal": 21,
    "window_id": "dd4ab4bc-3c70-571a-bf40-c52f55ba5c8c",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "text": "For example, to include the [`name`](spiders.html#scrapy.Spider.name) of the\nsource spider in the feed URI:",
        "text_sha256": "b2312eb49a2afa450f75a30b6f4191bce2cbeb154fde21bceff9a3af8a2fabe6",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 24101,
            "end": 24208,
            "line_start": 665,
            "line_end": 666
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "1. Define the following function somewhere in your project:",
        "text_sha256": "7ec1496ee3b748ccc8371454a700055380202ff2c2421cb9f4037fbca8151a6e",
        "source_candidates": [
          {
            "start": 24210,
            "end": 24269,
            "line_start": 668,
            "line_end": 668
          }
        ]
